{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CetKazQfhHXUdd4mzUoPX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. The build succeeded with 17 tests running (the existing tests plus my 4 new ones for the confirm endpoint).\n\n**Command:** `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/`\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS - All 17 tests passed (Tests run: 17, Failures: 0, Errors: 0)\n\n**Verification details:**\n- ShipmentControllerTest: 9 tests (5 existing + 4 new)\n- OrderControllerTest: 4 tests\n- CustomerControllerTest: 3 tests\n- SampleServiceApplicationTests: 1 test\n\nAll tests ran without failures or errors.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** - Maven build completed successfully\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** - All 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests still pass, plus 4 new tests\n3. ✅ **`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` confirms a created shipment** - Test: `confirms a CREATED shipment and transitions it to CONFIRMED`\n4. ✅ **Error responses are consistent with rest of API** - Uses same `ResourceNotFoundException` and `ConflictException` patterns with `GlobalExceptionHandler` error envelope\n5. ✅ **Repeated confirm succeeds, cancelled rejected (409), unknown id refused (404)** - Tests: `confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds`, `rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with 409`, `rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with 404`\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** - Only modified Kotlin files, no changes to pom.xml\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** - Only touched shipment feature files\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** - Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE` to ErrorCode enum. This was necessary and minimal, adding only what's needed for the 409 response when confirming a CANCELLED shipment.\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** - Added `confirm()` method with:\n   - 404 handling for non-existent shipments\n   - 409 handling for CANCELLED shipments  \n   - State transition from CREATED → CONFIRMED\n   - Idempotent behavior for CONFIRMED shipments\n   - All uses existing exception patterns and repository interface\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added 4 test cases covering:\n   - Happy path: CREATED → CONFIRMED transition\n   - Idempotency: CONFIRMED stays CONFIRMED\n   - Error case: CANCELLED rejection with 409\n   - Error case: Non-existent shipment with 404\n\nEach test uses existing MockMvc patterns and verifies both status and response envelope structure.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria are met.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm to confirm shipments, with idempotent behavior for CONFIRMED status, 409 for CANCELLED, and 404 for missing.\n\nChanged       ApiError.kt - Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE error code for 409 responses\n              ShipmentController.kt - Added confirm() POST endpoint with status transition logic\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt - Added 4 tests for confirm endpoint\n\nTests         - `confirms a CREATED shipment and transitions it to CONFIRMED` - verifies status change from CREATED to CONFIRMED\n              - `confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds and changes nothing` - verifies idempotent behavior\n              - `rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with 409 and the error envelope` - verifies 409 Conflict response\n              - `rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with 404 and the error envelope` - verifies 404 Not Found response\n\nVerification  Command: `./mvnw test` from sample-service/\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS - All 17 tests passed (5 existing + 4 new ShipmentControllerTest tests, plus other test classes)\n\nNot done      Nothing - all acceptance criteria met and verified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3298,"cache_read_input_tokens":23621,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3298},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"10975ac7-bf29-41ea-94e5-0bde68ce9532","uuid":"cb907ba7-1e13-4823-a768-c052e164f38b","timestamp":"2026-09-09T18:15:12.587Z","request_id":"req_011CetKayjV5HQMn3vwESqdY"}
